      "sourceTextSha256": "8e52042c282933d523a7f7b91f4bb7f8275aabfb52afbf9954a1e125c8fc1dd4",
      "text": "Day 1 · Arrival in Lima, meeting and transfer to the hotel. Lima is rich in pre-Inca and colonial monuments and home to numerous museums; not far from the city lie the ruins of Pachacamac, a mysterious pre-Inca ceremonial complex, and its craft markets offer beautiful, inexpensive souvenirs.",
